  "notes": "Transcribed from the lower 'RP2350A_V10 Pinout' diagram; the upper board render in the same image shows the same board and was not transcribed separately. Silkscreen GPIO numbers (16, 17, G...) placed first in functions; 'G' = GND silkscreen. A note box '3.6V-6.5V To 3.3V@800ma' spans the 5V and VBUS pins and is not assigned to either. GP29/ADC3 marked in the diagram as a difference from the original Pico2. KEY(GP23), LED(GP24), LED(GP25) callouts point to the button/LEDs, not pins."
